            "SwatchFile": "PainterlyNPR__MaterialSwatch__{Id}__{Key}__{Slot}__.webp",
            "SwatchFileNote": "Each swatch's file, in its group's folder: Id in two digits (Brick is 02), Slot RND (pen and wash) or PXY (the proxy). Drawn by the asset factory on the class's sample (17, Samples)"
